id: dominant-personality
name: Dominant Personality
# A Fusion Modifier: chosen as a Fusion is fused (fusion-make.mjs), never picked by hand. Its Prerequisite is shown there, never enforced.
fusionModifier: true
description: >
  One of the Fused Characters remains in control of your Fusion.
text: >
  Dominant Personality: One of the Fused Characters remains in control of your Fusion.
  (1)-[Prerequisite]: You only have 1 Non-Minion Fused Character, or 1 Fused Character has a higher Power Level than every other Fused Character
  (2)-[Passive]: Double the amount of Technique Points gained through Character Combination.
  (3)-[Passive]: Reduce the Ki Point Cost of all Attacking Maneuvers and Unique Abilities by 2(T).

---

[passive]
# (2) Read where its Technique Points are worked out (fusion-make.mjs combinationTP).
# (3)
attack.kiCost -= 2(T);
unique.kiCost -= 2(T);
